## PDP product facts (feature checklist)

From [`sleep-air-purifier-headboard`](https://airtulip.co/products/sleep-air-purifier-headboard):

- **Modes:** Whisper (quietest) · Night (stable “bubble”) · Day (stronger room cleaning).
- **Noise (published):** **26 dB(A)** whisper · **30 dB(A)** night · Day “much less than AC” (qualitative).
- **Filters:** Dual **HEPA H14** in metal cassettes (Twin: single); dual full-width **activated carbon** (Twin: single); **pre-filters** (count differs Twin vs larger).
- **Tech labels:** Patent-pending laminar flow; custom fan; curved acoustic insulation channels; honeycomb core; foam acoustic pathways.
- **Setup:** Arrives **fully assembled**; place behind bed, plug in (standard outlet).
- **Maintenance (FAQ):** Pre-filters checked/dusted; **HEPA ~12 months**; **carbon ~6 months** (usage-dependent); **pre-filter ~3 months** (subscription page aligns quarterly reminders).

